-- equal times count as out-of-date
rebuilding out
-- newer target is up to date
make: 'out' is up to date.
-- sub-second differences count
rebuilding out
make: 'out' is up to date.
-- a missing prerequisite with a rule is newer
making gen without creating it
t from gen
-- a symbolic link to its prerequisite is up to date
ln -sf ex view
make: 'view' is up to date.
